{"title":"시끄러","artist":"syudou","sourceId":"reference:7o9fAyqZRSEslHzySibI","sourceHash":"6bf3c53c11bff16ceb99b3bc1cabf2835f6ab0c155eb7036772fd6f86a011784","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":36839941,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.55,"end":3.72,"text":"正しさとは 愚かさとは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.72,"end":8.78,"text":"それが何か見せつけてやる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":16.8,"end":19.55,"text":"ちっちゃな頃から優等生","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":19.55,"end":21.81,"text":"気づいたら大人になっていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":21.81,"end":24.67,"text":"ナイフの様な思考回路","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":24.67,"end":27.31,"text":"持ち合わせる訳もなく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":27.31,"end":30.36,"text":"でも遊び足りない 何か足りない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":30.36,"end":32.78,"text":"困っちまうこれは誰かのせい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":32.78,"end":37.29,"text":"あてもなくただ混乱するエイデイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":37.29,"end":38.97,"text":"それもそっか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":38.97,"end":41.1,"text":"最新の流行は当然の把握","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":41.1,"end":43.53,"text":"経済の動向も通勤時チェック","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":43.53,"end":46.61,"text":"純情な精神で入社しワーク","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":46.61,"end":51.21,"text":"社会人じゃ当然のルールです","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":51.21,"end":54.38,"text":"はぁ？うっせぇうっせぇうっせぇわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":54.38,"end":56.7,"text":"あなたが思うより健康です","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":56.7,"end":59.85,"text":"一切合切凡庸な","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":59.85,"end":62.85,"text":"あなたじゃ分からないかもね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":62.85,"end":64.65,"text":"嗚呼よく似合う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":64.65,"end":68.35,"text":"その可もなく不可もないメロディー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":68.35,"end":70.89,"text":"うっせぇうっせぇうっせぇわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":70.89,"end":76.41,"text":"頭の出来が違うので問題はナシ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":85.32,"end":88.12,"text":"つっても私模範人間","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":88.12,"end":90.73,"text":"殴ったりするのはノーセンキュー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":90.73,"end":93.58,"text":"だったら言葉の銃口を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":93.58,"end":96.43,"text":"その頭に突きつけて撃てば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":96.43,"end":98.8,"text":"マジヤバない？止まれやしない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":98.8,"end":101.72,"text":"不平不満垂れて成れの果て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":101.72,"end":106.03,"text":"サディスティックに変貌する精神","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":106.03,"end":107.38,"text":"クソだりぃな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":107.38,"end":109.87,"text":"酒が空いたグラスあれば直ぐに注ぎなさい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":109.87,"end":112.25,"text":"皆がつまみ易いように串外しなさい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":112.25,"end":115.39,"text":"会計や注文は先陣を切る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":115.39,"end":120.23,"text":"不文律最低限のマナーです","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":120.23,"end":123.17,"text":"はぁ？うっせぇうっせぇうっせぇわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":123.17,"end":125.96,"text":"くせぇ口塞げや限界です","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":125.96,"end":131.65,"text":"絶対絶対現代の代弁者は私やろがい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":131.65,"end":133.43,"text":"もう見飽きたわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":133.43,"end":136.65,"text":"二番煎じ言い換えのパロディ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":136.65,"end":139.25,"text":"うっせぇうっせぇうっせぇわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":139.25,"end":144.69,"text":"丸々と肉付いたその顔面にバツ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":154.4,"end":159.96,"text":"うっせぇうっせぇうっせぇわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":159.96,"end":162.98,"text":"うっせぇうっせぇうっせぇわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":162.98,"end":165.51,"text":"私が俗に言う天才です","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":165.51,"end":168.07999999999998,"text":"うっせぇうっせぇうっせぇわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":168.07999999999998,"end":170.55,"text":"あなたが思うより健康です","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":170.55,"end":173.11,"text":"一切合切凡庸な","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":173.11,"end":176.32999999999998,"text":"あなたじゃ分からないかもね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":176.32999999999998,"end":178.11,"text":"嗚呼つまらねぇ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":178.11,"end":181.77,"text":"何回聞かせるんだそのメモリー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":181.77,"end":184.29,"text":"うっせぇうっせぇうっせぇわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":184.29,"end":186.29,"text":"アタシも大概だけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":186.29,"end":188.5,"text":"どうだっていいぜ問題はナシ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}